@startuml f3-operator-ws-subscribe
title F3 - Operator opens live observation (WS to State Registry via API Gateway)

|Operator|
start
:Open task detail view in UI;

|UI|
:Open WebSocket to API Gateway
 with bearer_token, /ws/tasks/:task_id, upgrade;

|API Gateway|
:Validate bearer_token;
note right
  GW's only logic on WS upgrade.
  Auth + route.
  State Registry is the historical state source.
  No Router involved.
end note
:Subscribe to State Registry for task_id events;
:Receive subscription ack from State Registry;
:Return WS upgrade ack to UI;
:Proxy WS frames between UI and State Registry
 for the duration of the connection;

|Operator|
:See live task view (historical events stream in as WS frames);

stop

@enduml